        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PSHNYK, Contemporary New York Solid Brass Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe New York Pushplate from Grandeur Decorative Hardware features a simple, contemporary style. The clean rectangular shape and crisp beveled edge will enhance your modern decor in homes, restaurants, clubs, or businesses. This Contemporary New York Solid Brass Push Plate is cast in high quality brass and offered in your choice of 6 different finishes. It is packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. It measures 2-3/4 inches wide and 10 inches high. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur Nostalgic Warehouse Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Contemporary New York Solid Brass Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose on the outside, it will still be brass material on the inside.\r\n</p>",
